# MCP and plugin policy

Do not install, enable, disable, or uninstall user-level Cursor plugins or MCP servers. Do not edit `~/.cursor/mcp.json`.

Project `.cursor/mcp.json` has no servers on purpose. Do not add MCP servers unless the developer explicitly asks.

**In policy** (use only if already present at user scope):

- Context7 — current library/framework docs
- Playwright — later isolated Forge UI checks; never `browser_run_code_unsafe`

**Out of policy** unless the developer names the tool in this conversation:

- GitLab, Sentry, Neon, Azure, AWS, Render, Vercel, Figma, Canva, Hugging Face, Apify, Roboflow, Context.dev, Obsidian, Cloudflare

Do not authenticate Sentry, Neon, GitHub MCP, Cloudflare, or any cloud account. Do not copy tokens from user MCP config into this repo.
